---
import Doc from '../../../layouts/Doc.astro';
import Pager from '../../../components/Pager.astro';
const slug = 'guides/non-interactive';
---
<Doc slug={slug} title="Non-interactive mode">
  <h1>Non-interactive mode</h1>
  <p class="lede"><code>--prompt</code> runs one turn and exits.</p>
  <h2>Capture an answer</h2>
  <pre><code>cortex --prompt "list every exported function in internal/ui" > api.txt</code></pre>
  <p>The answer goes to stdout. Tool activity, notices and errors go to stderr.</p>
  <h2>Use a specific config</h2>
  <pre><code>cortex --config reviewer.yaml --prompt "review the last commit"</code></pre>
  <p><code>--config</code> reads the named YAML file and environment overrides.</p>
  <h2>Stop a run</h2>
  <p>Ctrl-C ends the process. A one-shot run has a limit of 120 model calls.</p>
  <div class="docs-pager"><Pager slug={slug} /></div>
</Doc>
